# Screenshots/docs
#
# These three lines have to stay in this order. A global ignore
# (~/.gitignore_global) excludes `docs` outright, and git never descends into an
# excluded directory — so any `!docs/...` exception below it is unreachable.
# Un-ignore the directory itself first, re-ignore its contents, then carve out
# the one subtree we want tracked.
!docs/
docs/*
# Design handoff: Claude Design reads this repo over GitHub, so the brief and
# the captured screens must be committed for it to see them at all.
!docs/design-handoff/
.playwright-mcp/

